-line'>{}</span>", "ja522:44.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja522:44.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja522:45.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja522:45.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja522:45.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja522:45.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja522:45.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja522:45.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja522:46.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja522:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja522:0.2": "Cattālīsanipāta ", "ja522:0.3": "Tesakuṇavagga ", "ja522:0.4": "2. Sarabhaṅgajātaka ", "ja522:1.1": "“Alaṅkatā kuṇḍalino suvatthā, ", "ja522:1.2": "Veḷuriyamuttātharukhaggabandhā; ", "ja522:1.3": "Rathesabhā tiṭṭhatha ke nu tumhe, ", "ja522:1.4": "Kathaṁ vo jānanti manussaloke”. ", "ja522:2.1": "“Ahamaṭṭhako bhīmaratho panāyaṁ, ", "ja522:2.2": "Kāliṅgarājā pana uggatoyaṁ; ", "ja522:2.3": "Susaññatānaṁ isīnaṁ dassanāya, ", "ja522:2.4": "Idhāgatā pucchitāyemha pañhe”. ", "ja522:3.1": "“Vehāyasaṁ tiṭṭhasi antalikkhe, ", "ja522:3.2": "Pathaddhuno pannaraseva cando; ", "ja522:3.3": "Pucchāmi taṁ yakkha mahānubhāva, ", "ja522:3.4": "Kathaṁ taṁ jānanti manussaloke”. ", "ja522:4.1": "“Yamāhu devesu sujampatīti, ", "ja522:4.2": "Maghavāti taṁ āhu manussaloke; ", "ja522:4.3": "Sa devarājā idamajja patto, ", "ja522:4.4": "Susaññatānaṁ isīnaṁ dassanāya”. ", "ja522:5.1": "“Dūre sutā no isayo samāgatā, ", "ja522:5.2": "Mahiddhikā iddhiguṇūpapannā; ", "ja522:5.3": "Vandāmi te ayire pasannacitto, ", "ja522:5.4": "Ye jīvalokettha manussaseṭṭhā”. ", "ja522:6.1": "“Gandho isīnaṁ ciradikkhitānaṁ, ", "ja522:6.2": "Kāyā cuto gacchati mālutena; ", "ja522:6.3": "Ito paṭikkamma sahassanetta, ", "ja522:6.4": "Gandho isīnaṁ asuci devarāja”. ", "ja522:7.1": "“Gandho isīnaṁ ciradikkhitānaṁ, ", "ja522:7.2": "Kāyā cuto gacchatu mālutena; ", "ja522:7.3": "Vicitrapupphaṁ surabhiṁva mālaṁ, ", "ja522:7.4": "Gandhañca etaṁ pāṭikaṅkhāma bhante; ", "ja522:7.5": "Na hettha devā paṭikkūlasaññino”. ", "ja522:8.1": "“Purindado bhūtapatī yasassī, ", "ja522:8.2": "Devānamindo sakko maghavā sujampati; ", "ja522:8.3": "Sa devarājā asuragaṇappamaddano, ", "ja522:8.4": "Okāsamākaṅkhati pañha pucchituṁ. ", "ja522:9.1": "Ko nevimesaṁ idha paṇḍitānaṁ, ", "ja522:9.2": "Pañhe puṭṭho nipuṇe byākarissati; ", "ja522:9.3": "Tiṇṇañca raññaṁ manujādhipānaṁ, ", "ja522:9.4": "Devānamindassa ca vāsavassa”. ", "ja522:10.1": "“Ayaṁ isi sarabhaṅgo tapassī, ", "ja522:10.2": "Yato jāto virato methunasmā; ", "ja522:10.3": "Āceraputto suvinītarūpo, ", "ja522:10.4": "So nesaṁ pañhāni viyākarissati”. ", "ja522:11.1": "“Koṇḍañña pañhāni viyākarohi, ", "ja522:11.2": "Yācanti taṁ isayo sādhurūpā; ", "ja522:11.3": "Koṇḍañña eso manujesu dhammo, ", "ja522:11.4": "Yaṁ vuddhamāgacchati esa bhāro”. ", "ja522:12.1": "“Katāvakāsā pucchantu bhonto, ", "ja522:12.2": "Yaṁ kiñci pañhaṁ manasābhipatthitaṁ; ", "ja522:12.3": "Ahañhi taṁ taṁ vo viyākarissaṁ, ", "ja522:12.4": "Ñatvā sayaṁ lokamimaṁ parañca”. ", "ja522:13.1": "Tato ca maghavā sakko, ", "ja522:13.2": "atthadassī purindado; ", "ja522:13.3": "Apucchi paṭhamaṁ pañhaṁ, ", "ja522:13.4": "yañcāsi abhipatthitaṁ. ", "ja522:14.1": "“Kiṁ sū vadhitvā na kadāci socati, ", "ja522:14.2": "Kissappahānaṁ isayo vaṇṇayanti; ", "ja522:14.3": "Kassīdha vuttaṁ pharusaṁ khametha, ", "ja522:14.4": "Akkhāhi me koṇḍañña etamatthaṁ”. ", "ja522:15.1": "“Kodhaṁ vadhitvā na kadāci socati, ", "ja522:15.2": "Makkhappahānaṁ isayo vaṇṇayanti; ", "ja522:15.3": "Sabbesaṁ vuttaṁ pharusaṁ khametha, ", "ja522:15.4": "Etaṁ khantiṁ uttamamāhu santo”. ", "ja522:16.1": "“Sakkā ubhinnaṁ vacanaṁ titikkhituṁ, ", "ja522:16.2": "Sadisassa vā seṭṭhatarassa vāpi; ", "ja522:16.3": "Kathaṁ nu hīnassa vaco khametha, ", "ja522:16.4": "Akkhāhi me koṇḍañña etamatthaṁ”. ", "ja522:17.1": "“Bhayā hi seṭṭhassa vaco khametha, ", "ja522:17.2": "Sārambhahetū pana sādisassa; ", "ja522:17.3": "Yo cīdha hīnassa vaco khametha, ", "ja522:17.4": "Etaṁ khantiṁ uttamamāhu santo”. ", "ja522:18.1": "“Kathaṁ vijaññā catupattharūpaṁ, ", "ja522:18.2": "Seṭṭhaṁ sarikkhaṁ athavāpi hīnaṁ; ", "ja522:18.3": "Virūparūpena caranti santo, ", "ja522:18.4": "Tasmā hi sabbesaṁ vaco khametha”. ", "ja522:19.1": "“Na hetamatthaṁ mahatīpi senā, ", "ja522:19.2": "Sarājikā yujjhamānā labhetha; ", "ja522:19.3": "Yaṁ khantimā sappuriso labhetha, ", "ja522:19.4": "Khantī balassūpasamanti verā”. ", "ja522:20.1": "“Subhāsitaṁ te anumodiyāna, ", "ja522:20.2": "Aññaṁ taṁ pucchāmi tadiṅgha brūhi; ", "ja522:20.3": "Yathā ahuṁ daṇḍakī nāḷikero, ", "ja522:20.4": "Athajjuno kalābu cāpi rājā; ", "ja522:20.5": "Tesaṁ gatiṁ brūhi supāpakamminaṁ, ", "ja522:20.6": "Katthūpapannā isinaṁ viheṭhakā”. ", "ja522:21.1": "“Kisañhi vacchaṁ avakiriya daṇḍakī, ", "ja522:21.2": "Ucchinnamūlo sajano saraṭṭho; ", "ja522:21.3": "Kukkuḷanāme nirayamhi paccati, ", "ja522:21.4": "Tassa phuliṅgāni patanti kāye. ", "ja522:22.1": "Yo saññate pabbajite aheṭhayi, ", "ja522:22.2": "Dhammaṁ bhaṇante samaṇe adūsake; ", "ja522:22.3": "Taṁ nāḷikeraṁ sunakhā parattha, ", "ja522:22.4": "Saṅgamma khādanti viphandamānaṁ. ", "ja522:23.1": "Athajjuno niraye sattisūle, ", "ja522:23.2": "Avaṁsiro patito uddhampādo; ", "ja522:23.3": "Aṅgīrasaṁ gotamaṁ heṭhayitvā, ", "ja522:23.4": "Khantiṁ tapassiṁ cirabrahmacāriṁ. ", "ja522:24.1": "Yo khaṇḍaso pabbajitaṁ achedayi, ", "ja522:24.2": "Khantiṁ vadantaṁ samaṇaṁ adūsakaṁ; ", "ja522:24.3": "Kalābuvīciṁ upapajja paccati, ", "ja522:24.4": "Mahāpatāpaṁ kaṭukaṁ bhayānakaṁ. ", "ja522:25.1": "Etāni sutvā nirayāni paṇḍito, ", "ja522:25.2": "Aññāni pāpiṭṭhatarāni cettha; ", "ja522:25.3": "Dhammaṁ care samaṇabrāhmaṇesu, ", "ja522:25.4": "Evaṅkaro saggamupeti ṭhānaṁ”. ", "ja522:26.1": "“Subhāsitaṁ te anumodiyāna, ", "ja522:26.2": "Aññaṁ taṁ pucchāmi tadiṅgha brūhi; ", "ja522:26.3": "Kathaṁvidhaṁ sīlavantaṁ vadanti, ", "ja522:26.4": "Kathaṁvidhaṁ paññavantaṁ vadanti; ", "ja522:26.5": "Kathaṁvidhaṁ sappurisaṁ vadanti, ", "ja522:26.6": "Kathaṁvidhaṁ no siri no jahāti”. ", "ja522:27.1": "“Kāyena vācāya ca yodha saññato, ", "ja522:27.2": "Manasā ca kiñci na karoti pāpaṁ; ", "ja522:27.3": "Na attahetū alikaṁ bhaṇeti, ", "ja522:27.4": "Tathāvidhaṁ sīlavantaṁ vadanti. ", "ja522:28.1": "Gambhīrapañhaṁ manasābhicintayaṁ, ", "ja522:28.2": "Nāccāhitaṁ kamma karoti luddaṁ; ", "ja522:28.3": "Kālāgataṁ atthapadaṁ na riñcati, ", "ja522:28.4": "Tathāvidhaṁ paññavantaṁ vadanti. ", "ja522:29.1": "Yo ve kataññū katavedi dhīro, ", "ja522:29.2": "Kalyāṇamitto daḷhabhatti ca hoti; ", "ja522:29.3": "Dukhitassa sakkacca karoti kiccaṁ, ", "ja522:29.4": "Tathāvidhaṁ sappurisaṁ vadanti. ", "ja522:30.1": "Etehi sabbehi guṇehupeto, ", "ja522:30.2": "Saddho mudū saṁvibhāgī vadaññū; ", "ja522:30.3": "Saṅgāhakaṁ sakhilaṁ saṇhavācaṁ, ", "ja522:30.4": "Tathāvidhaṁ no siri no jahāti”. ", "ja522:31.1": "“Subhāsitaṁ te anumodiyāna, ", "ja522:31.2": "Aññaṁ taṁ pucchāmi tadiṅgha brūhi; ", "ja522:31.3": "Sīlaṁ siriñcāpi satañca dhammaṁ, ", "ja522:31.4": "Paññañca kaṁ seṭṭhataraṁ vadanti”. ", "ja522:32.1": "“Paññā hi seṭṭhā kusalā vadanti, ", "ja522:32.2": "Nakkhattarājāriva tārakānaṁ; ", "ja522:32.3": "Sīlaṁ sīrī cāpi satañca dhammo, ", "ja522:32.4": "Anvāyikā paññavato bhavanti”. ", "ja522:33.1": "“Subhāsitaṁ te anumodiyāna, ", "ja522:33.2": "Aññaṁ taṁ pucchāmi tadiṅgha brūhi; ", "ja522:33.3": "Kathaṅkaro kintikaro kimācaraṁ, ", "ja522:33.4": "Kiṁ sevamāno labhatīdha paññaṁ; ", "ja522:33.5": "Paññāya dāni paṭipadaṁ vadehi, ", "ja522:33.6": "Kathaṅkaro paññavā hoti macco”. ", "ja522:34.1": "“Sevetha vuddhe nipuṇe bahussute, ", "ja522:34.2": "Uggāhako ca paripucchako siyā; ", "ja522:34.3": "Suṇeyya sakkacca subhāsitāni, ", "ja522:34.4": "Evaṅkaro paññavā hoti macco. ", "ja522:35.1": "Sa paññavā kāmaguṇe avekkhati, ", "ja522:35.2": "Aniccato dukkhato rogato ca; ", "ja522:35.3": "Evaṁ vipassī pajahāti chandaṁ, ", "ja522:35.4": "Dukkhesu kāmesu mahabbhayesu. ", "ja522:36.1": "Sa vītarāgo pavineyya dosaṁ, ", "ja522:36.2": "Mettaṁ cittaṁ bhāvaye appamāṇaṁ; ", "ja522:36.3": "Sabbesu bhūtesu nidhāya daṇḍaṁ, ", "ja522:36.4": "Anindito brahmamupeti ṭhānaṁ”. ", "ja522:37.1": "“Mahatthiyaṁ āgamanaṁ ahosi, ", "ja522:37.2": "Tavamaṭṭhakā bhīmarathassa cāpi; ", "ja522:37.3": "Kāliṅgarājassa ca uggatassa, ", "ja522:37.4": "Sabbesa vo kāmarāgo pahīno”. ", "ja522:38.1": "“Evametaṁ paracittavedi, ", "ja522:38.2": "Sabbesa no kāmarāgo pahīno; ", "ja522:38.3": "Karohi okāsamanuggahāya, ", "ja522:38.4": "Yathā gatiṁ te abhisambhavema”. ", "ja522:39.1": "“Karomi okāsamanuggahāya, ", "ja522:39.2": "Tathā hi vo kāmarāgo pahīno; ", "ja522:39.3": "Pharātha kāyaṁ vipulāya pītiyā, ", "ja522:39.4": "Yathā gatiṁ me abhisambhavetha”. ", "ja522:40.1": "“Sabbaṁ karissāma tavānusāsaniṁ, ", "ja522:40.2": "Yaṁ yaṁ tuvaṁ vakkhasi bhūripañña; ", "ja522:40.3": "Pharāma kāyaṁ vipulāya pītiyā, ", "ja522:40.4": "Yathā gatiṁ te abhisambhavema”. ", "ja522:41.1": "“Katāya vacchassa kisassa pūjā, ", "ja522:41.2": "Gacchantu bhonto isayo sādhurūpā; ", "ja522:41.3": "Jhāne ratā hotha sadā samāhitā, ", "ja522:41.4": "Esā ratī pabbajitassa seṭṭhā”. ", "ja522:42.1": "Sutvāna gāthā paramatthasaṁhitā, ", "ja522:42.2": "Subhāsitā isinā paṇḍitena; ", "ja522:42.3": "Te vedajātā anumodamānā, ", "ja522:42.4": "Pakkāmu devā devapuraṁ yasassino. ", "ja522:43.1": "Gāthā imā atthavatī subyañjanā, ", "ja522:43.2": "Subhāsitā isinā paṇḍitena; ", "ja522:43.3": "Yo kocimā aṭṭhikatvā suṇeyya, ", "ja522:43.4": "Labhetha pubbāpariyaṁ visesaṁ; ", "ja522:43.5": "Laddhāna pubbāpariyaṁ visesaṁ, ", "ja522:43.6": "Adassanaṁ maccurājassa gacche. ", "ja522:44.1": "“Sālissaro sāriputto, ", "ja522:44.2": "meṇḍissaro ca kassapo; ", "ja522:44.3": "Pabbato anuruddho ca, ", "ja522:44.4": "kaccāyano ca devalo. ", "ja522:45.1": "Anusisso ca ānando, ", "ja522:45.2": "kisavaccho ca kolito; ", "ja522:45.3": "Nārado udāyitthero, ", "ja522:45.4": "parisā buddhaparisā; ", "ja522:45.5": "Sarabhaṅgo lokanātho, ", "ja522:45.6": "evaṁ dhāretha jātakan”ti. ", "ja522:46.1": "Sarabhaṅgajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {